* City Planning (Age II)
* Siege Directive (Age III)
* Grand Bazaar (Age IV)|In-game description}}
The '''Administration Wing''' is an [[Age]]-up [[Technology (Age of Empires IV)|technology]] for the [[Abbasid Dynasty]] in ''[[Age of Empires IV]]'' that can be researched at the [[House of Wisdom]]. It advances the player to the next Age, except when researched in the [[Imperial Age (Age of Empires IV)|Imperial Age]], and adds +5,000 hit points to the House of Wisdom. Additionally, it improves the effect of all [[Golden Age]] bonuses by 50%.

